sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor F as Finance desk
    participant FI as finance-service

    F->>F: download the bank statement as CSV
    F->>FI: POST /api/fees/bank/import (lines read in the browser: date, narration, reference, debit, credit)
    FI->>FI: skip lines already imported (same file twice adds nothing)
    loop each unmatched line
        alt money in
            FI->>FI: candidates: recorded payments by bank, UPI, card, cheque or online
        else money out
            FI->>FI: candidates: expenses, and refunds paid by a non-cash method
        end
        FI->>FI: same amount, and the entry's reference found in the narration
        alt exactly one
            FI->>FI: match it
        else amount only, one entry within 3 days
            FI->>FI: match it
        else two or more equal
            FI->>FI: leave it for a person: never guess
        end
    end
    FI-->>F: lines imported, duplicates, matched

    F->>FI: GET /api/fees/bank/summary
    FI-->>F: in the bank but not in the books, and in the books as bank money but not on the statement

    F->>FI: GET /api/fees/bank/lines/{id}/candidates, then POST .../match (or .../unmatch)
    FI->>FI: amounts must be equal, money in matches a payment, one bank line per entry
    FI->>FI: audit the match
